## Keep Explorer on the selected simulation graph
================================================================================

Context: Switching Explorer's Graph dropdown from Live to a ready sandbox
snapped back to Live after a few seconds. A later SigmaGraph.init() rebuilt
the dropdown from /simulation/list and lost the user's choice.

Changes:

1. src/front/static/query/js/query-sigmagraph.js
   Remember the selected simulation and skip a second Explorer init that
   would wipe the canvas and reset the Graph dropdown.
2. tests/units/front/test_explorer_simulation_select.py
   Cover persistence of the Graph choice across Explorer reloads.
3. docs/user-guide.md
   Note that Explorer keeps the selected sandbox until the user changes it.

